+def set_party_slot(user_id: int, position: int, user_warrior_id: int) -> bool:
+    """Place one owned warrior instance in a party slot.
+
+    A single owned *instance* may only occupy one slot.  If it was already in
+    this player's party, it is moved to the requested slot instead of being
+    silently cloned across the formation.  Separate duplicate copies remain
+    valid because they have different ``user_warriors.id`` values.
